# Duration of the Association Stages

This scope defines the fixed durations for the preparatory and transitional stages of the Association between the European Economic Community and Turkey.

```catala
declaration scope AssociationStages:
  output prep_stage_duration content duration
  output max_transitional_duration content duration
```

## Preparatory Stage Duration

The preparatory stage shall last five years, unless extended by agreement.

```catala
scope AssociationStages:
  date round down
  definition prep_stage_duration equals 5 year
```

## Maximum Transitional Stage Duration

The transitional stage shall last not more than twelve years.

```catala
scope AssociationStages:
  definition max_transitional_duration equals 12 year
```